	@ B0-BF: …, quotes, ♂, ♀, ¥, comma, ×, /, A-E
	@ C0-CF: F-U
	@ D0-DF: V-Z, a-k
	@ E0-EF: l-z, ▶
	@ F0-FF: :, umlauts, unused/control codes
